"are :math:`+7.29` for Ti and :math:`-5.75` for O∥."

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:124
msgid ""
"TiとO∥のBorn有効電荷は、形式電荷のそれぞれ約1.8倍と約2.9倍である。和は :math:`2.77+7.25-2.15\\times2-5.71=+0.01` で、 "
"和則をほぼ満たす。Berry位相の方法による計算でも、Ti :math:`+7.16`、O∥ :math:`-5.69` とほぼ同じ値が得られている "
"[ZhongKingSmithVanderbilt1994]_。:ref:`Löwdin電子数<lowdin>`\\ "
"のような静的な電荷は、ある構造で電子を原子に割り当てた量であり、変位に対する応答であるBorn有効電荷とは別の量である [GhosezMichenaudGonze1998]_。"
msgstr ""
"The Born effective charges of Ti and O∥ are about 1.8 and 2.9 times their respective formal "
"charges. The sum over all atoms in the cell (Ba, Ti, two O⊥, and O∥) is "
":math:`2.77+7.25-2.15\\times2-5.71=+0.01`, close to satisfying the sum rule. Berry phase "
"calculations give nearly the same values, :math:`+7.16` for Ti and :math:`-5.69` for O∥ "
"[ZhongKingSmithVanderbilt1994]_. Static charges such as :ref:`Löwdin electron populations "
"<lowdin>`\\  assign electrons to atoms in a given structure. Born effective charges instead "
"describe the response to a displacement [GhosezMichenaudGonze1998]_."

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:131
msgid "Berry位相による分極（概要）"
msgstr "Berry-Phase Polarization: An Overview"

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:133
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":eq:`fo-linear-polarization` は変位が小さい範囲の近似で、:math:`Z^*` 自体を求める方法も要る。King-SmithとVanderbiltは、 "
"分極の電子の寄与を、占有されたBloch関数の周期部分 :math:`u_{n\\boldsymbol k}` の\\ **Berry位相**\\ で表した "
"[KingSmithVanderbilt1993]_。 同じ量は、占有バンド :math:`n` のWannier関数の中心"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`fo-linear-polarization` approximates the response at small displacements. A "
"separate method is needed to obtain :math:`Z^*`. King-Smith and Vanderbilt expressed the "
"electronic contribution to polarization through the \\ **Berry phase**\\  of the periodic parts "
":math:`u_{n\\boldsymbol k}` of the occupied Bloch functions [KingSmithVanderbilt1993]_. The same "
"contribution can be written in terms of the center of the Wannier function for occupied band "
":math:`n`,"

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:137
msgid ""
"\\bar{\\boldsymbol r}_n=\\frac{\\Omega}{(2\\pi)^3}\\int_{\\mathrm{BZ}}\\langle u_{n\\boldsymbol "
"k}|\\,i\\nabla_{\\boldsymbol k}\\,|u_{n\\boldsymbol k}\\rangle\\,d^3k"
msgstr ""
"\\bar{\\boldsymbol r}_n=\\frac{\\Omega}{(2\\pi)^3}\\int_{\\mathrm{BZ}}\\langle u_{n\\boldsymbol "
"k}|\\,i\\nabla_{\\boldsymbol k}\\,|u_{n\\boldsymbol k}\\rangle\\,d^3k"

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:142
msgid ""
"を使って、イオンの芯（価数 :math:`Z_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{ion}}`、位置 :math:`\\boldsymbol "
"r_\\kappa`）とWannier中心の点電荷の双極子"
msgstr ""
"using this center to form the dipole moment of the point charges at the ionic cores (valence "
":math:`Z_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{ion}}`, position :math:`\\boldsymbol r_\\kappa`) and the Wannier "
"centers:"

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:144
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol P=\\frac{e}{\\Omega}\\Bigl(\\sum_\\kappa Z_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{ion}}\\boldsymbol "
"r_\\kappa-2\\sum_n\\bar{\\boldsymbol r}_n\\Bigr)"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol P=\\frac{e}{\\Omega}\\Bigl(\\sum_\\kappa Z_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{ion}}\\boldsymbol "
"r_\\kappa-2\\sum_n\\bar{\\boldsymbol r}_n\\Bigr)"

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:149
msgid ""
"と書ける（2はスピンの縮退）\\ [VanderbiltKingSmith1993]_ [Resta1994]_。Wannier関数の中心は格子ベクトルの分だけ不定なので、 :eq:`fo-"
"wannier-polarization` も :eq:`fo-polarization-quantum` の整数倍だけ不定で、1次元の鎖で見た性質と一致する。Born有効電荷は、:eq"
":`fo-wannier-polarization` を、巨視的な電場を0、セルを固定として原子の変位で微分したものにあたり、BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ の大きな値は、Tiが動くとO "
"2pのWannier中心が逆向きに動くこととして読める（\\ :ref:`Ti 3d–O 2pの混成の役割<fo-hybridization>`）。"
msgstr ""
"Here the factor of 2 accounts for spin degeneracy \\ [VanderbiltKingSmith1993]_ [Resta1994]_. A "
"Wannier center is defined modulo a lattice vector, making Equation :eq:`fo-wannier-polarization` "
"ambiguous by integer multiples of Equation :eq:`fo-polarization-quantum`, as in the one-"
"dimensional chain. The Born effective charge is the derivative of Equation :eq:`fo-wannier-"
"polarization` with respect to an atomic displacement at zero macroscopic electric field and fixed"
" cell. Its large values in BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\  reflect the motion of the O 2p Wannier centers in "
"the opposite direction to the Ti displacement (see \\ :ref:`Role of Ti 3d–O 2p Hybridization <fo-"
"hybridization>`)."

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:152
msgid ""
"Berry位相で分極の差を求めるときは、参照構造から目的の構造まで、途中のどの構造でもバンドギャップが開いている経路をとり、 その上で分極の枝を連続的に追う。:eq:`fo-wannier-"
"center` は占有バンドと非占有バンドがすべての :math:`\\boldsymbol k` で分かれていることを前提にしており、 "
"途中で金属になる経路では占有状態が定まらず、Berry位相が定義できない [KingSmithVanderbilt1993]_ [Spaldin2012]_。"
msgstr ""
"To compute a polarization difference using the Berry phase, choose a path from the reference "
"structure to the target structure that maintains an open band gap at every intermediate "
"structure. Track the polarization continuously along a single branch. Equation :eq:`fo-wannier-"
"center` assumes that the occupied and unoccupied bands are separated for every "
":math:`\\boldsymbol k`. If the path passes through a metallic structure, the occupied states are "
"no longer uniquely determined and the Berry phase is undefined [KingSmithVanderbilt1993]_ "
"[Spaldin2012]_."

#: ../../solid/polarization.rst:156
msgid ""
"Born有効電荷は、イオン結晶のΓ点で縦波と横波の光学モードの振動数が分かれる\\ :ref:`LO–TO分裂<lo-to-splitting>`\\ の大きさも決める。ZhongとKing-"
"Smith、Vanderbiltは、ペロブスカイト型の強誘電体で大きなBorn有効電荷のためにLO–TO分裂が巨大になることを示した "
"[ZhongKingSmithVanderbilt1994]_。"
msgstr ""
"Born effective charges also determine the magnitude of the \\ :ref:`LO–TO splitting <lo-to-"
"splitting>`\\ , the difference between longitudinal and transverse optical frequencies at the Γ "
"point in ionic crystals. Zhong, King-Smith, and Vanderbilt showed that large Born effective "
"charges in perovskite ferroelectrics produce a giant LO–TO splitting "
"[ZhongKingSmithVanderbilt1994]_."

